WEBVTT

00:00.150 --> 00:01.485
The Carina Nebula.

00:02.185 --> 00:06.114
A great cloud in the southern sky, in the constellation of the Keel.

00:06.564 --> 00:09.058
Monster stars live inside it.

00:09.508 --> 00:18.003
Their fierce winds and ultraviolet light are carving the gas into the shapes you see: walls, pillars and hollows, lit from within.
